<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-κόπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut down, fell</i>, of trees, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.15.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				2.15.4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut in pieces, cut up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.48
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1688
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					301c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακοπείς</span>
			<i>cut in pieces</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cut down, massacre, butcher</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.29
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ βόες κατεκόπησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.235S.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in a military sense,
				<i>cut in pieces, 'cut up</i>', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μόραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					13.22
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακοπῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.2.25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακεκόψεσθαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.5.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πληγαῖς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					37.20
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> generally, <i>break in pieces, destroy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφάνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					22.70
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέραμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.25.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρια ὑπὸ τῶν σέων κατακοπτόμενα</span>
			<i>fretted in pieces</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				730
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				1
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακέκοπταί οἱ τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς γαῦρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.762f
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεκόπημεν ἄν</span> we
				<i>should have been made mince-meat of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>weary, bore</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxipp.
				1.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				70
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>8.</b> Rhet.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις -κεκομμένη</span>
				'<i>staccato', jerky</i> composition, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>9.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστοὺς κατεκόψατο</span>, in
			vehement grief, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				316
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>strike with a die, coin</i> bullion <i>into money</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.96
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θρόνον ὄντα ἀργυροῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.5.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Χρυσᾶς πλίνθους εἰς νόμισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.56
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				281
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				14.45
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
